#: includes/class-settings.php:121
msgid ""
"Our site is taking a short break because of a technical problem. It usually comes back within a few minutes.\n"
"\n"
"This page refreshes on its own. Thank you for your patience."
msgstr ""
"Notre site fait une courte pause à cause d’un problème technique. Il revient en général au bout de quelques minutes.\n"
"\n"
"Cette page se rafraîchit toute seule. Merci de votre patience."

#: includes/class-settings.php:130
msgid "Back in a minute"
msgstr "De retour dans une minute"

#: includes/class-settings.php:131
msgid ""
"We are installing an update. The site will be back in a moment.\n"
"\n"
"This page refreshes on its own. Thank you for your patience."
msgstr ""
"Nous installons une mise à jour. Le site revient dans un instant.\n"
"\n"
"Cette page se rafraîchit toute seule. Merci de votre patience."

#: includes/class-settings.php:140
msgid "Something went wrong"
msgstr "Un problème est survenu"

#: includes/class-settings.php:141
msgid ""
"A technical error prevents us from displaying this page right now. Please try again in a few minutes.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your patience."
msgstr ""
"Une erreur technique nous empêche d’afficher cette page pour le moment. Réessayez dans quelques minutes.\n"
"\n"
"Merci de votre patience."

#: includes/class-site-health.php:43
